Further to this success the company's productions have also received nominations from such varied awards bodies as the Academy Awards,[[39]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-39) the Laurence Olivier Awards, The Monte Carlo International Television Festival,[[40]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-40) The Screen Actors Guild,[[41]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-41) The American Society of Cinematographers,[[42]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-42) The Edgar Allan Poe Awards,[[43]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-43) The Rose D’Or[[44]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-44) and The San Sebastian Film Festival.[[45]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnival_Films#cite_note-45)
